0..74 Comment "//! A layout of a truth value that loses the value: each constant is zero."
75..78 Comment "//!"
79..152 Comment "//! A layout is admitted by its equivalence with the type. A model of the"
153..229 Comment "//! theory of truth can give its two constants one bit pattern, because that"
230..307 Comment "//! theory states no rule that parts them. So the model checks, and the fault"
308..340 Comment "//! must show at the round trip."
341..344 Comment "//!"
345..421 Comment "//! The encoder is the fold into the model, and the decoder is the fold into"
422..498 Comment "//! the truth values. The round trip at the true value needs a path from the"
499..564 Comment "//! false value to the true value. The checker refuses that path."
565..568 Comment "//!"
569..585 Comment "//! - see: #8288"
